~ start
do knock()

Gabriel: Hey, Lucius? ‘You there?
Lucius: Yeah, I’m here. Come in.

do remove_black_screen()

#do set_expression(“confused”)
Gabriel: Are you alright?
Gabriel: You seem a little out of it lately.
Lucius: Just a bit more… tired than normal. That last case took a lot out of me.
Gabriel: Well, sorry to break it to you. We’ve got another case, and it’s a big one.
#do set_expression(“glassesshine”)
Lucius: Hm? What are we looking at?
#do set_expression(“frown”)
Gabriel: A murder. Benjamin Esteban.
Lucius: Esteban… familiar name…
Lucius: Wait, the senator? Benjamin Esteban?
Gabriel: Yup. Found dead in his office just a few hours ago. Hasn’t reached the news yet, and they’re hoping to keep it that way.
Lucius: All right. Go start the car. I just need to get a few things. 
do kill_gab()
=> END

~ incomplete_journal
Lucius: I can't leave before I prepare my journal.
=> END

~ leave
Lucius: Everything's ready. Let's get going.

=> END